        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b) The recall or hire of ACST, CST, or SCST Installers as a result of the one time adjustment in paragraph 4(a) shall occur, if necessary, at the time Installers who elect the voluntary severance offer in paragraph 3 leave the roll; provided, however, that Installer(s) on the recall list as of the date of the voluntary severance offer, will remain eligible for recall, solely for purposes of the one time adjustment, until the off roll date of any extended volunteer(s).",
